SUMMARY:If I Can't Dance I'm Not Coming
LOCATION:Edinburgh
DESCRIPTION:A new collaboration by choreographer Karl Jay-Lewin and compose
 r Matteo Fargion. If I Can’t Dance I’m Not Coming reframes Fritz Lang
 ’s 1927 masterpiece Metropolis\, translating silent cinema into a rigorou
 s choreographic score. Performed by an eclectic ensemble of eight\, the wor
 k rejects virtuosity in favour of dignity\, threading humour\, rebellion an
 d flashes of tenderness through a democratic creative process. Extending Ja
 y-Lewin and Fargion’s acclaimed Extremely series\, the work resonates wit
 h quiet political force. MadeInScotlandShowcase.com\nMore info: https://com
 edyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/if-i-can-t-dance-i-m-not-coming/
URL:https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/if-i-can-t-dance-i-m-not-com
 ing/
END:VEVENT
